    "detailed_description": "<strong>Seal the Rift is a single player roguelike deckbuilder that offers endless replayability.<br>Each playthrough brings a unique combination of cards, relics, magic, enemies and events. Ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.poster.avif?t=1734093465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.webm?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.mp4?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Choose from countless cards to shape your deck.<br>    </li><li>Acquire game changing relics.<br>    </li><li>Fight against unique and challenging enemies. If you are defeated, your run is over.<br>    </li><li>Explore a map that changes with each playthrough, balancing risk and reward as you choose your path.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Down on your luck?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Control your fate by utilizing &quot;Boost&quot;. A powerful tool that lets you enhance the potency of one card in your hand.<br>    </li><li>Turn things around by casting magic. A precious and limited resource. Expand your arsenal of spells by defeating bosses.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your adventurer</strong></h2>Choose from 2 adventurers, each with a thematic deck allowing for diverse playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.poster.avif?t=1734093465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.webm?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.mp4?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up</strong></h2>Increase your level to unlock additional cards and relics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover synergies</strong></h2>Discover powerful synergies between cards and relics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show your mastery</strong></h2>Unlock account titles based on your high score.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark fantasy setting</strong></h2>A rift has opened, unleashing terrible monsters and dark forces into the world. Those who ventured before you have met with failure. The forest has been corrupted, the castle has transformed into a living graveyard and there are whispers of a dragon sighting.<br><br>Now the world's fate is in your hands. Are you up for the challenge?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Seal the Rift is a single player roguelike deckbuilder that offers endless replayability.<br>Each playthrough brings a unique combination of cards, relics, magic, enemies and events. Ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.poster.avif?t=1734093465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.webm?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/7b303fec3dc6abfdcde19da1c1f29e54.mp4?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Choose from countless cards to shape your deck.<br>    </li><li>Acquire game changing relics.<br>    </li><li>Fight against unique and challenging enemies. If you are defeated, your run is over.<br>    </li><li>Explore a map that changes with each playthrough, balancing risk and reward as you choose your path.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Down on your luck?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Control your fate by utilizing &quot;Boost&quot;. A powerful tool that lets you enhance the potency of one card in your hand.<br>    </li><li>Turn things around by casting magic. A precious and limited resource. Expand your arsenal of spells by defeating bosses.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your adventurer</strong></h2>Choose from 2 adventurers, each with a thematic deck allowing for diverse playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.poster.avif?t=1734093465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.webm?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853180/extras/af2480d28c2c3cafd6831ca2c5a89603.mp4?t=1734093465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up</strong></h2>Increase your level to unlock additional cards and relics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover synergies</strong></h2>Discover powerful synergies between cards and relics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show your mastery</strong></h2>Unlock account titles based on your high score.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark fantasy setting</strong></h2>A rift has opened, unleashing terrible monsters and dark forces into the world. Those who ventured before you have met with failure. The forest has been corrupted, the castle has transformed into a living graveyard and there are whispers of a dragon sighting.<br><br>Now the world's fate is in your hands. Are you up for the challenge?",
